  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut sweet potato into fries.\n• Place fries on lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle over Nan's special seasoning and toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-659b81514a9edcff4d23901e-2b0c9a9c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, combine the plain flour, plant-based milk and garlic & herb seasoning in a shallow bowl. In a second shallow bowl, place panko breadcrumbs (see ingredients).\n• Coat plant-based burger patties in the flour mixture, followed by the panko breadcrumbs. Transfer to a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-659b81514a9edcff4d23901e-0b57c539.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When fries have 10 minutes remaining, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• When oil is hot, cook plant-based burger patties until browned and heated through, 2-3 minutes each side. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.\n• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Slice haloumi horizontally to get 1 piece per person.\n• Wipe out pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook haloumi, until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. TIP: For even browning, gently press down on the patties using a spatula.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-659b81514a9edcff4d23901e-8191b9b4.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, slice avocado in half, scoop out flesh and thinly slice.\n• In a medium bowl, combine a drizzle of the balsamic vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper.\n• Just before serving, add spinach & rocket mix and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-659b81514a9edcff4d23901e-51458a40.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Halve plant-based burger buns and bake directly on a wire oven rack, until heated through, 2-3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-659b81514a9edcff4d23901e-d05c83a9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spread each base with some plant-based aioli.\n• Top with a crumbed plant-based patty, haloumi slice, some avocado slices and some salad.\n• Divide burgers and spiced fries between plates. Serve with any remaining aioli. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-659b81514a9edcff4d23901e-a2cce6a8.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
